  <article class="tp-article">

  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> divide your inseam (crotch to floor) by your height. Legs are typically about <strong>47%</strong> of height; under about <strong>45.5%</strong> means a long torso. Quick check: three or more fingers fit between your lowest rib and your hip bone.</p></div>

